WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Roon homepage promo film V2 (39.7s, silent — the text
on screen IS the narration). V2 re-cut (2026-10-30): beats 1-4 unchanged
from v1; the ending now lands on video and experience, not the book —
new beat-5 visual (family settling in to watch) and new closing lines.
Timings follow the overlay fades in the master build
(promo-src/build-v2.sh): each line appears as its overlay fades in and
